hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"52","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab ne Abu Waqid Laithi se poocha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eid-ul-Adha aur Eid-ul-Fitr mein kya padha karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Aap donon mein (Qaaf wal-Qur'aanil-Majid) aur (Iqtarabatis-Sa'atu wanshaqqal-Qamar) padha karte the."
"53","[AI-translation] Jabir (raziallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne ashaab ke paas tashreef laye aur unhein Surah-ur-Rahman awwal se aakhir tak padh kar sunayi toh woh khamosh reh gaye. Aap ne farmaya: Maine ise lailat-ul-jinn mein jinno ko padha tha toh woh tum se behtar jawab dene wale the. Jab bhi main is qawl (Fabi-ayyi aalaa-i Rabbikuma tukazziban) par pahuncta toh woh kehte: Ham ne teri kisi nemat ko nahi jhutlaya ai hamare Rab! Tere liye tahmid hai."
"54","[AI-translation] Saeed bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) youm-e-jumu'a ki fajr ki namaz mein (Alif-Laa-Meem Tanzeel) Sajdah aur (Hal ata alal-insani heenun min-ad-dahr) padha karte the, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz-e-jumu'a mein Surah Al-Jumu'ah aur Surah Al-Munafiqeen padha karte the."
